      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8822375056346829528, guid: c270e3531e0d343bcb1442339f3a4e72, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levelSequences.Array.data[0].steps.Array.data[0].text
      value: Notice how the cat qubits can't make it through the screen?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8822375056346829528, guid: c270e3531e0d343bcb1442339f3a4e72, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levelSequences.Array.data[0].steps.Array.data[1].text
      value: That means that our circuit needs to be simplified!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8822375056346829528, guid: c270e3531e0d343bcb1442339f3a4e72, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levelSequences.Array.data[0].steps.Array.data[2].text
      value: Click on these two gates and then click on substitute!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8822375056346829528, guid: c270e3531e0d343bcb1442339f3a4e72, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levelSequences.Array.data[0].steps.Array.data[3].text
      value: When all the qubits make it through you pass the level!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8822375056346829528, guid: c270e3531e0d343bcb1442339f3a4e72, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levelSequences.Array.data[1].steps.Array.data[0].text
      value: 'Remember, if you get stuck, you can press the Hint button for a hint, '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8822375056346829528, guid: c270e3531e0d343bcb1442339f3a4e72, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levelSequences.Array.data[1].steps.Array.data[1].text
      value: ' If you want a reminder for how to play, press the Info button, '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8822375056346829528, guid: c270e3531e0d343bcb1442339f3a4e72, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levelSequences.Array.data[1].steps.Array.data[2].text
      value: Click on these two gates and then click on substitute!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8822375056346829528, guid: c270e3531e0d343bcb1442339f3a4e72, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levelSequences.Array.data[1].steps.Array.data[3].text
      value: 'Great Job! Notice how the qubits are making it through now?

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8822375056346829528, guid: c270e3531e0d343bcb1442339f3a4e72, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levelSequences.Array.data[2].steps.Array.data[0].text
      value: Sometimes disaster events will strike!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8822375056346829528, guid: c270e3531e0d343bcb1442339f3a4e72, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levelSequences.Array.data[2].steps.Array.data[1].text
      value: They can be a heat wave!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8822375056346829528, guid: c270e3531e0d343bcb1442339f3a4e72, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levelSequences.Array.data[2].steps.Array.data[2].text
      value: Or maybe an earthquake!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8822375056346829528, guid: c270e3531e0d343bcb1442339f3a4e72, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levelSequences.Array.data[2].steps.Array.data[3].text
